        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "> Drawn to the Flame: POWER: Ra deals each non-hero target 1 fire damage for each villain ongoing card in play.\n\n\n\n> Scorched Earth: Ra deals each non-hero target X fire damage, where X = the number of environment cards in play.\n\n\nIf Ra uses the Drawn to the Flame power when there are two villain ongoing cards in play, does Ra do one attack to each non-hero target for two fire damage each or does Ra do two attacks to each non-hero target for one fire damage each?",
